cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TSE Pulseq for MATLAB"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB/Pulseq tools for Cartesian 2D turbo spin echo sequence development
  toward vendor-neutral deployment, including conventional TSE and gSlider-TSE.
  The current implementation and scanner validation are based on Siemens 7 T
  systems, and the bundled offline reconstruction currently targets conventional
  2D TSE Siemens Twix data.
